A new version is out. It does not bring any new scenarios but addresses multiple long standing issues. Unless a serious bug is found (and fixed) or there are translations updates, this will be the last verion for Wesnoth 1.18. I want to focus to porting and play testing the campaign to/on the upcoming Wesnoth 1.20.

Starting dialogue of scenario The Path of Revenge was improved, the enemy in the scenario gets more hitpoints on normal and hard. Enemies in scenario Return of the Orcs now have villages closer to their castles at start now. There is now a reminder of the objective of scenario Flight if one is taking too long to complete it and the turn limit was lowered to 12. Scenario An Exercise was renamed to An Unexpected Obstacle and West Front to All Wicked on the Western Front. Jolla now always has the illuminates ability in scenario March to the East, the starting dialogue was tweaked to take into account whether she and Lemyr have the ability or not. Jolla also gets special abilities and weapon specials to help her survive and deal more damage (one has to start Chapter 4 again or advance her to higher level to get them).